DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The hhddss driver attaches to Hitachi Modular Storage logical units.  Each
     path to an active service processor attached to by hhddss is presented to
     mpath(4) which uses it as a backend to the logical unit attached to its
     own scsibus(4).

